3. WORKFLOW SPECIFICATIONS & DEPENDENCIES

This license directly covers the structural node design, detailing logic, and 
evaluation configurations for the following tools provided in this repository:

A) Flux2Klein Workflow Setup
   - Core Model Target: flux-2-klein-9b-fp8.safetensors
   - Text Encoder Dependency: qwen_3_8b_fp8mixed.safetensors
   - Base Execution Profile: 35 Generation Steps, sgm_uniform scheduler, 
     3.5 Positive FluxGuidance, 1.0 Negative FluxGuidance.
   - Detailing Pipe Pass: 15 Detailing Steps utilizing karras scheduling logic.

B) Flux3Klein Workflow Setup
   - Core Model Target: flux3-image-klein-int8-convrot.safetensors
   - Text Encoder Dependency: flux-3-image-klein-text_encoder-FP8.safetensors
   - Base Execution Profile: 40 Generation Steps, beta scheduler, 
     4.5 Positive FluxGuidance, 0.0 Negative FluxGuidance.
   - Detailing Pipe Pass: 20 Detailing Steps utilizing beta scheduling logic.

